    "Expect: Player 2 slot3 also takes 2 damage instead of 1 and remains in play with damageReceived 2; after battle resolves, Player 2 slot2 is destroyed by battle.",
    "Action: Inspect Player 1 energy area after both ST08-013 plays resolve.",
    "Expect: Exactly 2 of Player 1's 5 energy cards are rested from paying both Cost 1 plays, and 3 energy cards remain active."
